  "metadata": {
    "id": "murmur-dark-bass",
    "name": "DARK BASS",
    "author": "Patchwork Eight Engineering",
    "description": "Bright saw carrier (OP0) plus a sub sine an octave down (OP1), pushed through Filter 1 (lowpass, cutoff ~500Hz, moderate resonance for character). Darkness now comes from real filtering rather than oscillator choice alone. Two mod routes demonstrate classic subtractive-bass behavior: the shared envelope opens the filter briefly on attack (AmpEnvelope -> FilterCutoff), and harder hits brighten the tone (Velocity -> FilterCutoff).",
